/*
  OCEAN SCANNER - CUSTOM DETECTION STRINGS
  ========================================
  This local file seeds the scanner before the dashboard config arrives.
  Anything you add on /dashboard/strings is merged on top of it at scan time,
  so the website editor always wins.

  FORMAT: "search_term": "description shown in the report"

  Where each term is searched:
    - file and folder names on disk (FiveM data dirs, Downloads, Temp, AppData)
    - running process names
    - strings extracted from live process memory (explorer, lsass, dnscache)
    - the DNS client service cache
    - service / prefetch / event-log artifact tables
    - registry keys and values

  Matching is case-insensitive. Keep terms short and specific: a bare word
  like "cheat" produces noise, "nvevade" or "fivem_cheat.dll" does not.
*/

